      "writtenOn": "2023-10-24T05:46:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Let me share the pseudo code of the program to be hooked.\n\nif (error) {\n    call_func_exported_from_our_module();\n}\n\nWe call functions exported from our module to collect SD card related errors and use them for failure diagnostics.\nOur kernel module is tightly coupled with our userspace programs so we can not submit upstream.",
      "parentUuid": "32b1af32_55858a1b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1872,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 1872,
        "endChar": 41
