        "id": 1970009
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-10-25T05:37:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Our purpose is just to monitor error information and store it in our logging system. We are not handling errors. The thing is, customer sometimes returns the device due to SD card related behavior. As you know, there are many SD cards from various vendors. We can not test them all ourselves and we can not distinguish the root cause of the return is the device or SD card without error information.\n\nIf we find some unexpected errors with this logging information, we\u0027ll try to solve and contribute it upstream. Dose this answer make sense?",
      "parentUuid": "4b6273d1_a5b58d77",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1872,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 1872,
        "endChar": 41
      },
      "revId": "30d807f7d3b8bf3fd0624278ca94e8fb03b253d0",
